  "sourceTitle": "Adding MCP Tools to Reachy Mini",
  "sourceBodyHash": "aec13599973b7970e83215c62c96c01c6d9a372042fb10c0655529e17eee8849",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "partial",
  "importanceLevel": 4,
  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-15T12:18:23.332835Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-19T03:48:21.426835Z",
  "totalBlocks": 92,
  "translatedBlocks": 81,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a957d1941331322",
      "translationZh": "Reachy Mini 不用再看窗外，也能告诉你天气了",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "609ea57b0c08e55b",
      "translationZh": "Reachy Mini 对话应用现在可以使用托管在公共 Hugging Face Spaces 上、通过 MCP 调用的工具。你只需从 Hub 添加一个 Space，而不必修改应用，就能赋予机器人新的能力，比如查询天气或搜索网页。工具仍在 Space 本身运行，因此不会有代码下载到你的机器上。你也可以发布自己的工具，供其他人使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49b7fd6eb6d8b321",
      "translationZh": "添加工具只需一条命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e8ce5bf881580d3f",
      "translationZh": "然后像往常一样启动应用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18b2ce85701b0286",
      "translationZh": "现在你可以直接问：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48ab4d19604535a0",
      "translationZh": "下面，我们将介绍什么是工具、配置档案如何控制机器人可以使用哪些工具，以及远程调用方式目前的局限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f575ea148f895735",
      "translationZh": "内置工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb3e5f0404f6d309",
      "translationZh": "当你与机器人交谈时，得到的不只是语音回应，而是一个会对对话作出反应的系统：在适当的情况下，机器人可以做出动作，并以非语言方式回应。这里我们想重点介绍的是让这些成为可能的工具。工具就是模型在对话过程中可以执行的操作：表现一种情绪、转动头部、通过摄像头观察。每个工具都有一个名称和一段简短描述。模型会阅读这些信息，判断何时某个工具能派上用场，调用它，并利用返回的结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd4602e4ebc143c4",
      "translationZh": "目前，所有工具都在本地运行，并随应用一起发布，其中大多数都与机器人的身体有关：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e53bdcd0740867b",
      "translationZh": "工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c74ea9dc9cd25b58",
      "translationZh": "功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f82ac4b388ebbf7",
      "translationZh": "将一次头部姿态变更加入队列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f3234bc3d0c4243",
      "translationZh": "播放或清除舞蹈库中的一支舞蹈",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "21a2dcfb404c749d",
      "translationZh": "播放或清除已录制的情绪片段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efac703c46886202",
      "translationZh": "开启或关闭头部跟踪偏移",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89e8b9518d922794",
      "translationZh": "相机",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c4f249a6650ae95",
      "translationZh": "捕获一帧并进行分析",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcaaf906c9720f32",
      "translationZh": "在空闲回合中明确保持空闲状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4c2ffe38f1a5242a",
      "translationZh": "配置档案如何控制工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c83874d787d2fcc",
      "translationZh": "代码中的工具只有在某个配置目录中启用后才能使用。这里所说的配置目录是一个文件夹，其中有两个重要文件：instructions.txt（提示词）和 tools.txt（已启用的工具）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4bd10ea0616346b",
      "translationZh": "默认配置会启用全部工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef4ddf94315174b6",
      "translationZh": "如果某个名称不在 tools.txt 中，模型就无法调用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73c68c40f360bb95",
      "translationZh": "你也可以编写自己的工具：向配置目录（或 external_tools/）中添加一个 Python 文件，为它指定名称和描述，然后将该名称列入 tools.txt。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c85d6afb5438f6a",
      "translationZh": "目前既有内置工具，也有自定义的本地工具，由 tools.txt 决定启用哪些工具。这种方式很适合机器人的身体控制，也能让受信任的核心保持精简。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5e2d2c9b10d8eea2",
      "translationZh": "本地工具的局限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddf6e05423a7e510",
      "translationZh": "这里的限制在于，每个工具都必须是本地 Python 工具。对于 move_head 或 play_emotion 来说，这样做是合适的：它们与硬件交互，理应放在应用中。但许多有用的功能与机器人的身体无关，比如网页搜索、天气或信息查询。对于这些功能，把一切都放在本地主要是在增加麻烦：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5a74284e7523d591",
      "translationZh": "共享一个工具，就意味着要把你的 Python 文件交给别人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8f9e8fa4ad4828c3",
      "translationZh": "更新它意味着要重新发送那些文件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39649f65bf8a8fdc",
      "translationZh": "修改它意味着要编辑应用，尽管这项能力实际上独立于应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "537138ba86c7a0e1",
      "translationZh": "调用 Spaces 中的工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de6ccaae11fa92f6",
      "translationZh": "除了已有的内置工具和自定义本地工具，远程工具增加了第三种类型，适用于那些更容易独立发布、共享和更新的能力：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4971a784e27e8759",
      "translationZh": "内置机器人工具仍在本地运行，且值得信任",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "33af98b2eadb5bd7",
      "translationZh": "可共享的远程工具可以托管在公开的 Hugging Face Spaces 中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "282d2300b4c5fa1b",
      "translationZh": "你仍然可以使用 external_tools/ 中为特定用途定制的工具。这种方式很适合搜索、天气和信息查询等无状态能力：也就是你希望在不改动应用本身的情况下进行迭代的任何功能。而且，由于任何人都可以发布兼容的 Space，因此共享工具并在彼此工作的基础上继续构建都很容易。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce5c7c3bc0bdc948",
      "translationZh": "我们先从两个金丝雀工具入手，它们是用于检验新流程的小型测试工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7efad009e4aedb0",
      "translationZh": "它们足以检验整个功能流程：从 Hub 安装，发现远程工具，按配置文件启用它们，再让实时后端像调用内置工具一样调用它们。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f799f617108db654",
      "translationZh": "要同时使用这两者，请分别添加这两个 Space，它们的工具就会汇集到同一个配置文件中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09971722c3799e2e",
      "translationZh": "现在，机器人可以在同一次对话中搜索网页并查询天气，这正是下方 canary_web_search_weather 配置文件所实现的功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "980bd7fc10754222",
      "translationZh": "安装、列出、移除",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e37f4ab8d59bc422",
      "translationZh": "add 会验证 Hub 上的 Space，探测 MCP 端点，发现其工具，并默认将工具 ID 追加到当前配置文件的 tools.txt 中。除非你设置了 REACHY_MINI_CUSTOM_PROFILE，否则当前配置文件为 default。使用 --install-only 可跳过追加工具 ID 这一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f397e56a608e39b",
      "translationZh": "tools.txt 是把关者：只有当远程工具的 ID 出现在该配置文件的 tools.txt 中，与所需的内置工具一同列出时，该远程工具才会处于启用状态。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "34745c29464a245e",
      "translationZh": "清单的存放位置",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e13b7768cce4f78e",
      "translationZh": "已安装的源会持久化存储在以下位置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0f3e5dbdfbfceac3",
      "translationZh": "托管应用模式下的 installed_tool_spaces.json",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7b6c471c2a30489",
      "translationZh": "终端模式下的 external_content/installed_tool_spaces.json",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8228b1977d60c7f9",
      "translationZh": "工具命名",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3966eea198f63ae0",
      "translationZh": "每个已安装的 Space 都会获得一个由其 slug 派生的本地别名，其中连字符、点和斜杠会统一转换为下划线：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9bc7a93d78c73bc0",
      "translationZh": "随后，远程工具会使用双下划线划分命名空间：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "79208be456fb05e2",
      "translationZh": "这样既能避免远程工具名称与内置工具名称冲突，也能让多个 Space 在同一配置中共存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d5de803d1f705f0",
      "translationZh": "该实现还会尽可能去除冗余的 Space 名称前缀，将冗长的远程工具名称变成更简洁的本地 ID。如果去除前缀会导致同一 Space 中的两个工具发生名称冲突，代码就会回退到带有完整命名空间的名称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "abcfa3b6e71f1b90",
      "translationZh": "注册表层面还设有重复名称安全检查：Tool.name 的值必须在整个合并后的工具集中保持唯一。如果两个来源声明使用同一个名称，应用就会立即报错终止。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0cb52e6020257413",
      "translationZh": "配置示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dc1d9eee27d34b1f",
      "translationZh": "为开展这项工作，我们创建了两个用途明确的金丝雀测试配置，将 MCP 实验与完整的具身工具集隔离开来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b81b18d77149fb5",
      "translationZh": "第一个配置保留了几个用于表现情绪和动作的工具（情绪、头部运动），并在此基础上添加了网页搜索：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf1a0e6f444de8b6",
      "translationZh": "第二个配置与第一个相同，只是在搜索之外又加入了天气工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76d02e221c7b2282",
      "translationZh": "这组精简的实体动作工具意味着，Reachy Mini 在利用网络信息回答时事问题的同时，仍然能够做出生动的反应。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b302e1d0c16270a",
      "translationZh": "为什么提示词很重要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7c5c8a6c51b47a04",
      "translationZh": "远程工具的底层连接机制让模型能够接入工具。提示词则决定模型如何使用这些工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2aab3d7249b68b0d",
      "translationZh": "这一点在搜索加天气的金丝雀测试中尤为明显。例如，一个组合问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "372e92cf5d63f2d0",
      "translationZh": "至少可以用三种方式处理：先查天气再搜索、先搜索再查天气，或者在同一轮中同时进行。如果提示词含糊不清，模型就会串行执行这些调用，造成不必要的延迟。因此，金丝雀测试的提示词成了功能的一部分，而不再只是附带的配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "69db958167c57fdb",
      "translationZh": "目前哪些可用，哪些不可用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5faf58a69db59058",
      "translationZh": "能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c165800065d11429",
      "translationZh": "支持情况",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c821b3d6a179c480",
      "translationZh": "通过 slug 安装公开且兼容 MCP 的 Gradio Spaces（标准 /gradio_api/mcp/ 端点）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "56282717056e00c3",
      "translationZh": "一次处理多个 Spaces",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "93241e3e427299ca",
      "translationZh": "通过 tools.txt 按配置文件启用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b480d21507f43091",
      "translationZh": "带命名空间的远程工具 ID",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd0d7d199cd722d8",
      "translationZh": "不依赖后端的注册（OpenAI、Gemini、Hugging Face）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4124758bbe94c181",
      "translationZh": "不会将任意代码下载到本地应用中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51cddce88dd495ec",
      "translationZh": "私有或需要身份验证的 Spaces",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32a7a629cbc72e82",
      "translationZh": "非 Gradio Spaces",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d1e273f045c7353",
      "translationZh": "任意原始 MCP URL 或非 Hugging Face 的 MCP 服务器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a95b6a64001c45f7",
      "translationZh": "保证并行的工具编排",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa7f9fffdfc32fd9",
      "translationZh": "有两点值得强调。首先，Space 必须真正具备 MCP 服务器的行为；如果工具发现失败，安装就会失败。其次，提示词指令可以鼓励并行调用，但无法保证这一点。如果某个用例需要确定性编排，就应当把这部分逻辑从提示词移到代码中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6fe3781deb3570c1",
      "translationZh": "发布工具 Space 的建议",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a0f19444e5b4bac",
      "translationZh": "如果你希望其他人使用你的工具，请将其发布为公开的 Gradio Space，暴露标准 MCP 端点，并让工具保持无状态，以便它们通过网络良好运行。Space 能否安装取决于这种运行时行为，而不是标签。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3741ddb90c0160bd",
      "translationZh": "安装并不要求设置标签，但标签有助于人们找到兼容的 Space：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89db2ad881f29c18",
      "translationZh": "结论",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8240831b32da1b97",
      "translationZh": "现在，应用中的三类工具共享同一个注册表：内置工具、本地自定义工具和远程 MCP 工具，而配置文件仍然决定着每个助手可以访问其中哪些工具。一个小型、可信的核心始终位于中心，外围的可选功能则可以在不改动应用本身的情况下添加、测试和替换。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b5b50be81d6fb07f",
      "translationZh": "我们现在最好奇的是，大家会构建出什么。如果你发布了一个工具 Space，请为它添加 reachy-mini-tool 和 mcp 标签，以便其他人找到它。我们很期待看到 Reachy Mini 最终能做到些什么！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "228d282e60b2de1b",
      "translationZh": "致谢：非常感谢 Fabien Danieau 校对本文并协助测试工作流程，感谢 Andres Marafioti 协助测试，也感谢 Remi Fabre 和 Pollen Robotics 团队提供的想法与反馈，帮助完善了远程工具工作流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
